{
  "name": "AI Client Intake & Lead Qualification Engine",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Hybrid AI Lead Qualification System (Cloud Compatible)\n\n**Path 1: Lead Intake & AI Personalization**\n1. Webhook receives lead info from website contact form\n2. n8n HTTP Request node fetches target website via Jina Reader (blazing fast, bypasses blocks)\n3. Code node (JS) cleans data and handles timeouts gracefully\n4. Google Gemini generates a custom, highly-personalized pitch based on real site analysis & prospect's custom message\n5. Gmail node sends the email using your connected account\n6. Google Sheets node logs the lead, bottleneck, and status\n\n**Path 2: Meeting Booked Confirmation**\n1. Calendly Webhook receives meeting booking confirmation\n2. Google Sheets node updates lead status to \"Meeting Booked\"\n3. Telegram node sends instant notification to your phone\n\n**Built by M R Khan - AI Automation Systems**",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 500
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        0
      ],
      "id": "sticky-note-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
