      "id": "http-scrape-id",
      "name": "Scrape Website HTML"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const scrapeResult = $input.first().json;\nconst lead = $('Extract Lead Fields').first().json;\n\n// Get data from Jina response (usually in data or response or row)\nlet rawText = '';\nif (typeof scrapeResult.data === 'string') {\n  rawText = scrapeResult.data;\n} else if (typeof scrapeResult.response === 'string') {\n  rawText = scrapeResult.response;\n} else if (scrapeResult.row) {\n  rawText = JSON.stringify(scrapeResult.row);\n} else if (scrapeResult.error) {\n  rawText = 'Failed to scrape: ' + scrapeResult.error;\n} else {\n  rawText = JSON.stringify(scrapeResult);\n}\n\nconst html = rawText.toLowerCase();\nconst hasForm = html.includes('<form') || html.includes('form') || html.includes('input');\nconst hasCalendly = html.includes('calendly.com');\nconst hasHubspot = html.includes('hubspot.com');\n\nreturn {\n  ...lead,\n  analysis: {\n    status: rawText.startsWith('Failed') ? 'down' : 'live',\n    has_form: hasForm,\n    has_scheduling: hasCalendly || hasHubspot,\n    scheduling_tool: hasCalendly ? 'Calendly' : (hasHubspot ? 'HubSpot' : ''),\n    website_text: rawText.substring(0, 2500)\n  }\n};"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        420
      ],
      "id": "parse-scrape-id",
      "name": "Clean Scrape Data"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the lead qualification brain for M R Khan's AI Automation Systems (mrkhan7x.github.io).\n\nHere is the lead information:\nName: {{ $json.firstName }} {{ $json.lastName }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nWebsite: {{ $json.website }}\nProspect's Message about their bottleneck: \"{{ $json.message }}\"\n\nHere is the website analysis:\n- Website status: {{ $json.analysis.status }}\n- Has form: {{ $json.analysis.has_form }}\n- Has scheduling: {{ $json.analysis.has_scheduling }}\n- Scheduling tool: {{ $json.analysis.scheduling_tool }}\n- Raw website text snippet:\n\"\"\"\n{{ $json.analysis.website_text }}\n\"\"\"\n\nBased on this analysis and their message, generate a highly personalized pitch.\n\nCRITICAL EMAIL GUIDELINES:\n1. Refer to their message about: \"{{ $json.message }}\" naturally in the email. E.g. \"Since you mentioned you're dealing with [bottleneck]...\"\n2. Never mention n8n, APIs, Groq, or python. Sell the outcome, not the tool.\n3. Keep the tone human, casual, and direct. No buzzwords.\n4. Subject line must be short, lowercase, and curious.\n5. Address their site status:\n   - If the site is down/failed to scrape: Let them know as a value-add, then bridge to automation.\n   - If they have no form and no scheduling: Explain that they're forcing prospects to call/email manually and losing leads.\n   - If they have a form but no scheduling: Explain that their submissions sit in an inbox and they waste hours playing email tag to book calls.\n   - If they have scheduling: Suggest adding an AI qualification gate to protect their calendar from unqualified bookings.\n\nReturn a JSON object with the following fields:\n- email_subject: The subject line\n- email_body: The email body\n- linkedin_draft: A short connection request message\n- primary_pain_point: The main bottleneck identified\n- is_qualified: true if they are a service business/agency/consultancy, false if not a fit",
        "options": {}
      },
